    tree -->|loads the card tree| state @vi-onview
    detail -->|loads one card's full text| state @vi-detail
    rollup -->|loads decided, open, and stale counts| state @rollup
    switcher -->|lists the projects, and adds a folder picked in the folder dialog| projectlist @werk-projects-list,werk-projects-add,werk-projects-add-protocol
    tree -->|the check button accepts a ghost| accept @werk-propose-new
    detail -->|its remove control removes the card| accept @werk-remove,vi-remove-btn,vi-remove-btn-reparent,vi-remove-btn-ghost-no-x
    flow -->|its removed filter's restore button restores the card| accept @vi-flowtab-removed
    tree -->|shift+click forks a conversation at that card| live @werk-mc-open
    accept -->|appends the events| log @werk-propose-new,werk-remove
    approvebar -->|asks before a risky action runs| live @werk-approve,werk-approve-requests
    composer -->|sends what you type, and uploads each pasted image at once, before the send| live @werk-chat,werk-chat-image-inline
    transcript -->|streams the reply as it is written| live @werk-progress,werk-chat-turn-id
    tabs -->|switches which chat is live| live @werk-mc-follow
    header -->|shows the model and context left| live @werk-model-select,werk-model-persist-chat-read
    state -->|asks for today's state| foldfn @werk,vi-overwrite
    foldfn -->|reads every past decision| log @pr-log
    live -->|starts the agent for a message| runner @werk-chat-stdin
    runner -->|runs one child per conversation| child @werk-invoke
    runner -->|saves each conversation| chatlog @werk-two-files,werk-mc-shared-convo-log
    runner -->|checks no other server is running| lock @werk-onelock
    runner -->|starts the next child with the saved rules| allow @werk-perm-native
    runner -->|records each chat turn's cost, conversation and open card when the turn ends| pipelog @ms-store-plan
    live -->|checks and stores each pasted image, and serves its thumbnail| attachments @werk-chat-image-inline,werk-shots,werk-chat-image-inline-sniff
    child -->|sends a call its own engine could not decide| gate @werk-perm-native
    gate -->|keeps the always-allow rules| allow @werk-perm-native
    gate -->|appends each answered question| asks @werk-approve-log
    gate -->|asks you when unsure| approvebar @werk-approve
    child -->|proposes a change to the map| cli @werk-propose-new,werk-contract-where
    cli -->|appends the change| log @pr-log,pr-log-refuse
    cli -->|lists sibling conversations and reads one transcript| chatlog @werk-mc-recall,werk-cli-recall
    cli -->|appends a follow-up record for a done ticket to the board log| board @werk-cli-followup,ms-outcome-followup
    measure -->|reads each conversation's button waits from its chat history| chatlog @ms-outcome-interv-chat,ms-outcome-interv-chat-q
    measure -->|reads when each structured question went up and resolved| asks @ms-outcome-interv-chat,ms-outcome-interv-chat-q
    measure -->|reads the diagram job's ended runs for the local-redraw share| pipelog @vi-flow-localrate
    measure -->|folds each ticket's time in each column from the board's moves| board @ms-col-time
    log -->|copies a decision out| tracker @vi-backend,tk-verbs
    dev -->|reloads the server on a code change| runner @werk-hmr
    child -->|runs the two test commands itself| unittest @werk-test
    child -->|runs the browser flows itself| e2e @werk-test
    ci -->|runs the test commands on a clean machine| unittest @werk-ci
    ci -->|runs the browser flows on a clean machine| e2e @werk-ci
    ci -->|a green run lets a person tag that commit as a release| release @werk-release,werk-ci
    release -->|updates the formula to the new version and its checksums| tap @werk-release,werk-dist-channel
    e2e -->|boots the real server and drives the live routes| live @werk-test-visual
    child -->|writes the diagram source directly, no log entry| diagram @vi-sysdiag-grid-junction
    log -->|a change in the decided cards starts one run| diagramsync @vi-sysdiag-quiet
    diagramsync -->|runs the scout and the updater, which redraw the diagram source| diagram @vi-sysdiag-quiet,vi-sysdiag-agents
    diagramsync -->|records each run's end: result, declared outcome, starting cards, time, cost| pipelog @vi-flow-localrate
    tree -->|its Build button plans the card's subtree, in one detached process| planner @werk-board-build-subtree,werk-board-restart
    planner -->|reads one decided subtree, writes any new decision back| cli @st-spec,st-spec-answers
    planner -->|puts the tickets on the board| board @st-ticket,vi-board,st-plan-archive,vi-board-plan
    planner -->|starts the merge loop over the planned tickets, with no pause| merger @werk-board-build-subtree
    log -->|each change to a cited card| ticketwatch @st-ticket-watch
    ticketwatch -->|moves each open ticket that cites it to blocked, with the reason| board @st-ticket-watch
    board -->|triggers one ticket's build; archiving the ticket ends it| implement @werk-board-control,st-build-died,werk-board-control-archive-ends-build,st-build-died-detached,st-build-died-cap
    implement -->|when a build the board started ends, moves its ticket to merging on green, or back to ready with the reason at the retry cap| board @st-build-ticket-hand-off
    implement -->|runs the checks on the diff| check @st-build-ticket
    check -->|green: grade the diff| grade @st-build-ticket
    grade -->|pass: review the diff| review @st-build-ticket
    check -->|red: a new pass with the failure| implement @st-build-ticket,lp-stateless
    grade -->|fail: a new pass with the gap| implement @lp-prod-judge,lp-stateless
    review -->|CRITICAL or HIGH: a new pass with the findings| implement @lp-prod-review,lp-stateless
    review -->|queues a finished ticket| merger @st-build-run
    merger -->|sends a conflicting ticket back with the conflict| implement @st-build-run
    merger -->|runs the held-out set on the merged tree| heldout @st-build-run,st-validate-heldout,st-heldout-beside
    heldout -->|sends the text of a failed step| implement @lp-heldout-feedback,st-heldout-followup-per-ticket
    planner -->|records each plan, spec, and ticket step, with the scope cards each plan read, and keeps a copy of the spec and tickets each plan wrote| pipelog @ms-store,ms-store-scope,ms-store-plancopy
    implement -->|records each builder pass's start, end, and cost| pipelog @ms-store,werk-v0-pipeline-log,st-build-died-record
    implement -->|proposes a card for a decision no card makes, or names the cards it followed, to close the build's card obligation| cli @st-build-missing-decision,st-build-card,st-build-card-event
    merger -->|moves tickets through merging and done| board @werk-board-columns
    overseer -->|watches each agent session for a stuck one| implement @lp-overseer,lp-overseer-det
    child -->|spawns the prototyper subagent| prototyper @al-sample-proto-agent,al-ask-own-options

